WEBVTT

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.520
Hey! The one with the captain armband is-

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.040
I don't like this.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:16.100
I feel like a hoodlum, wearing this armband.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:21.790
Gino's the captain?

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:25.110
And No.7 is a rookie...

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.720
Interesting indeed, Tatsumi.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:17.190
That's hilarious! Exiling Murakoshi and replacing him with that no-good Gino as captain.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:20.060
There must be some conspiracy going on!

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:23.270
Having that winning mentality...

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:26.460
And then coming out at us...

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:32.690
I'm sure nobody will mind me being in the spotlight, eh?

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:35.560
Nobody gives a damn anyway.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:39.060
Tatsumi must be quite lonesome, since he just arrived back.

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:42.810
I suppose we can entertain the gaffer for a bit.

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:49.880
Are you sure your plan's gonna work?

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:55.870
I won't question Akasaki's and Sera's inclusion, but I feel it's still too early for Tsubaki...

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:03.280
Macchan.

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:07.860
This will be a battlefield for the next ninety minutes.

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:09.850
You will just have to trust the lads.

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:15.030
The moment one's resolve wavers, he'll get swallowed up by his opponents.

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:20.730
I'm really looking forward to this.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:22.250
Yeah.

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:25.170
Show us what you're made of, Tatsumi.

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:29.550
Show us how you'll use that footballing brain of yours to bring the champions down to their knees!

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:42.950
That should be the Croatian that Tatsumi mentioned about.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:48.780
So, you will be my date for today, huh?

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.020
Mikumo's the name.

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:59.010
Though I'm not one to tolerate partners that have multiple affairs...

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:01.810
Will you be loyal enough to stick close to me, Miku?

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:07.400
Nice interception, Shironishi!

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:08.410
Mochida!

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:13.340
Mochida...

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:16.320
A Japanese international...

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.760
He's definitely a cut above the rest.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:24.310
They've succeeded in their long pass!

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:27.540
Don't get thumped so early in the game, you guys!

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:35.950
What a pity!

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:37.290
That was close!

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.490
Get your acts together, lads!

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:41.730
Shackle down Mochida!

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:46.420
It's so dangerous whenever the ball gets to Mochida.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:49.190
The heart of Victory, eh?

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:55.640
It'll spell trouble if we are being overwhelmed by our opponents.

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:09.990
First up, just like previous years,

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:14.980
After wrestling back possession, you will focus all passes to Gino.

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:21.700
Will this tactic really unlock Victory's defence?

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:27.640
Koshi, you don't have to bust your guts just to pass me the ball.

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:33.110
No good! He will get double-teamed!

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:36.510
It's all yours, Zaki!

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:43.280
It's okay, Zaki. Give me back the ball.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:50.630
So Gino will still be the centre of all attacks this season?

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:56.270
But like his nickname suggests, the Prince still continues to do whatever he likes.

00:05:56.980 --> 00:06:00.210
He's certainly not captain material in my opinion.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:05.370
Or did Gino undergo some changes? Or maybe...

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:16.670
From the right again?

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:21.020
Why are they focusing their attacks on Saric's side?

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:24.510
Is he thinking of passing the ball to the centre of the pitch?

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:29.670
I must not get side-tracked.

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:33.180
For now, the key man in attack is this guy.

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:40.690
He's upholding his resposibility as the captain. As an anchor man, I won't let him have his way!

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:44.810
Is that really alright, Miku?

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:01.500
Impossible! There wasn't anyone in that area behind me just now!

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:04.420
The defence is cleared out.

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:07.840
Go forth, Tsubaki!

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.320
Who the hell's that guy?! He's fast!

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.490
People around him, provide support!

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:17.080
Hold him back, Akimori.

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:27.090
He's through! Furthermore, that defender is a Japanese international!

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:31.360
Don't let him shoot! Cover up the shooting space!

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:43.950
I miscued it.

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:51.250
T-That was some good chemistry there.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:59.410
How did he get into the centre area in a blink of an eye?

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:01.970
Let me introduce them, Miku.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:05.650
That is my adopted dog, Baki.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:10.290
But don't mind him, just keep marking me.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:16.780
What was that just now?

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:21.540
Is that the legs a human should have? What is he, an animal?

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:27.320
As I expected, this ETU team led by Tatsumi is certainly interesting.

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:31.020
What happened to Tsubaki?

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:33.770
His performance was not up to par during our training camp...

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:37.050
He's definitely someone whom people can't understand.

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:41.160
However, that's our Tsubaki, Macchan.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:44.830
During the last day of our training camp...

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:46.890
I finally knew...

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:00.400
Aim, shoot and goal!

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:07.310
Nice move!

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:13.800
You're certainly having fun with the ball.

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:16.390
Manager?

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:21.110
My bad, my bad. I didn't mean to disturb you.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.490
How about letting me join in...

00:09:25.310 --> 00:09:25.890
Tsubaki.

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:47.430
You just have to dribble, and then do some mid-range shooting.

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:49.640
Make sure you shoot outside the penalty area.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:54.400
As for me, I'll be standing here as defence.

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:57.400
Alright! Come at me!

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:08.580
Concentrate... concentrate.

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.880
Though the manager saw an embarrassing side of me, this is my chance!

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:19.100
I need to use this opportunity to atone for my dismal performance during the camp!

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:25.640
I need to...

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:32.730
I need to take this chance!

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:41.120
Well, that's a bit too pathetic!

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:44.770
Sorry!

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:49.570
Calm down, calm down. I just used too much force just now!

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:56.300
It's always due to this that I always fail!

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:58.810
Take it easy...take it easy.

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:08.790
But I'll probably leave a bad impression if I accidentally hit the manager!

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:16.510
Are you kidding me?

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:18.710
No! That not it!

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:23.490
What in the world am I doing?!

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:27.050
The manager's mad now. That's for sure!

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:29.610
I'll really have to do my best!

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:40.010
Is the goalmouth really that small?

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:45.000
Calm down...calm down!

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:53.430
The next one... I'll score the next one!

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:59.670
Oh forget it, Tsubaki.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.280
No!

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:03.440
Why not?

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:05.880
Just one more time...give me another chance!

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.450
Well, I have already known...

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:39.550
You're such a coward...

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:42.880
...yet intriguing.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:47.130
A little pressure is all it takes for your confidence to crumble.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:53.160
However, during the training match, you showed me the potential to beat Murakoshi.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.660
How can a coward like you show such great potential?

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:04.060
I...have had my fair share of good and bad moments.

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:10.740
In that match, Murakoshi urged me to do my best.

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:16.010
That's why I felt pumped up then.

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:28.670
Besides, your words...

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:34.810
Giant...killing.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:40.960
There he goes again!

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:41.950
That guy!

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.710
That's a foul!

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:56.960
Hey! That's supposed to be a free kick!

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:07.480
Manager, before the training match, you mentioned,

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:13.790
"As long as you win, your position in the squad will change immensely."

00:14:15.590 --> 00:14:17.720
"This will be your first step towards giant killing."

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:23.450
I...

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:27.630
...want to change!

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:36.020
I have always hated this side of me since years ago.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.410
I'm totally useless.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:45.630
Feeling mad about myself.

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:48.050
Feeling gutted.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.210
Although I know that in my heart...

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:56.650
I can't go on like this forever.

00:14:57.760 --> 00:14:58.880
But...

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:02.190
All you need to do is remain like this.

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:05.640
I heard you've been doing image training.

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:09.890
Almost all the time, you will stay back to train by yourself after practice.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.450
How did you know that?

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:19.270
I learnt that from your middle school coach when I phoned him up.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.360
As well as the coach from the amateur league.

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:26.910
From the beginning, you have always wanted to strengthen your resolve.

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:29.550
It has already become a strength of yours.

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:35.530
You don't have a good track record in the past.

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:41.280
Despite that, you still made it to the regular team in a top club.

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:45.980
All your coaches said that.

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:50.180
Though you have failed nine times out of ten,

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:57.290
That one time you succeeded, you have managed to make people sit up and take notice.

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:04.740
And those people whose attention you've caught have always been right behind you.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.300
That's because you have the potential, Tsubaki.

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:13.930
So do your best, no matter how many times you fail.

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:19.590
Conversely, all you need is that one time...

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:21.850
Make the spectators cheer for you.

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:25.740
Have your opponents tremble in fear.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.220
Bring out the power of giant killing in you.

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:38.890
Tsubaki's attacking ability is working very well.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:43.900
Our opponent's defence are now sitting deep, which makes it easier to gather the ball at the centre.

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:46.690
Our strategy is gradually becoming effective.

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:49.930
Now, it's time to score some goals.

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:52.930
That legs of yours ain't half-bad.

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:57.000
It's the Japanese international, Mochida!

00:16:57.550 --> 00:16:58.700
How old are you?

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:01.340
Twenty!

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:08.140
You're so young! You're just getting started. Do your best!

00:17:09.030 --> 00:17:09.830
Yes.

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:14.400
However, this world is pretty cruel, you know.

00:17:16.860 --> 00:17:18.970
Pay close attention from now on!

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:24.950
Make a good pass to me!

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:27.520
Come here, Miku!

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.770
Everything will be fine if you just stick to me.

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:36.450
It's this tactic again. All I have to do is pay attention to No.7's sudden breakthrough.

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:44.370
No. The main threat is still this man's play making.

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:48.030
Mikumo's catching up, Prince!

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:49.820
Great! Let's go, Tsubaki!

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:55.240
Crap!

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:58.690
Didn't I warn you a second ago?

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:05.490
This world's pretty cruel.

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:22.530
So do your best,

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:25.760
No matter how many times you fail!

00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:29.000
Conversely,

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:31.440
All you need is that one time...

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:35.530
Bring out the power of giant killing in you!

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:39.050
That's it!

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:41.130
No.7, Tsubaki!

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:52.970
What?

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:54.570
What's with that guy?

00:18:57.690 --> 00:19:00.680
The one that should be marked out...is him!

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:05.370
Cover up the shooting space! Don't let him shoot!

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:07.100
I have to stop you!

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:09.800
He's coming!

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:12.180
Yes, the fish fell for the bait.

00:19:18.810 --> 00:19:20.370
That's disappointing, Miku.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:22.460
I have already warned you for the umpteenth time.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:46.640
Goal! ETU scored!

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:53.360
Good job, Gino!

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:59.400
Prince! Prince! Prince!

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:03.400
That's the little present I prepared for you, Tatsumi!

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:24.680
Changing your tactics so early in the game?

00:20:26.210 --> 00:20:29.390
You two will take turns to take out Gino.

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:34.300
The opponents wants both of you to mark Gino.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:35.990
Understand?

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:44.640
Tatsumi was able to see through us in such a short amount of time.

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:48.810
What I'm saying is that he made use of Mikuno's pride.

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:54.180
Gino, whom was man-marked by Mikuno.

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:56.770
If he were to face Saric on his own,

00:20:56.990 --> 00:21:01.660
The opponent would be freed up of an extra player, leaving a huge gap in the centre of the pitch.

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:04.420
Therefore, we will have to man-mark a different person...

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:09.560
However for the young Mikuno, he won't have left it like this.

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:13.620
As a regular of a great team, his pride won't allow him to do that.

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:19.330
Moreover, the opponent's captain is right in front of his eyes.

00:21:20.150 --> 00:21:22.720
It wouldn't be a surprise if his attention had been diverted.

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:26.220
However, this is nothing but a fluke.

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:28.640
We wouldn't be wavered that easily.

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:30.180
Shiro!

00:21:31.550 --> 00:21:33.760
I'll be changing tactics for a bit.

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:43.390
I can get this!

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:54.230
I didn't touch him just now!

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:02.550
Yellow?

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:04.050
Was there even contact?

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:05.630
Who knows.

00:22:06.280 --> 00:22:07.920
But the opponent was trying to challenge him.

00:22:09.460 --> 00:22:12.160
He definitely did a good job with it.

00:22:25.660 --> 00:22:27.510
The taker's Mochida, Dori!

00:22:28.000 --> 00:22:29.300
It will certainly be Mochida!

00:22:30.290 --> 00:22:31.430
Got it.

00:22:32.740 --> 00:22:35.390
That said though, his kick...

00:22:44.420 --> 00:22:46.550
Damn, we conceded.

00:24:15.370 --> 00:24:17.560
That Mochida is despicable!

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:18.780
That's why we have to counter!

00:24:18.930 --> 00:24:20.930
I can see that you guys aren't satisifed with just this.

00:24:21.060 --> 00:24:22.200
Crap!

00:24:22.870 --> 00:24:25.040
Don't think about not losing!

00:24:25.230 --> 00:24:28.450
How do you look at me as a player?
